  id: DisSeismoscope
  displayName: Seismoscope
  description: 'A bronze urn ringed by eight dragons, each with a ball in its mouth:
    when the earth stirs, a ball drops into a toad below. <color=#fc8>Warns of earthquakes
    and eruptions on this world 35 seconds earlier</color>, and people braced in
    time take 15% less quake damage. One is enough.'
